	(text "G  The whole chain  -  audio in to speaker out"
		(at 12.7 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ad515bc-8ee5-466a-90b8-86764dc600de")
	)
	(text "input: level -> buffer -> inverter"
		(at 55.88 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0abd143a-7ad3-4865-a929-2e8d0232b466")
	)
	(text "PWM comparators"
		(at 215.9 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f7054d37-e554-40ad-98c1-77c85fd25fe0")
	)
	(text "triangle carrier"
		(at 33.02 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a8f0e3fa-b00f-4f15-8953-5af8b46631e4")
	)
	(text "complement generation"
		(at 190.5 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "250b599c-927d-4002-a9c1-ce7d511b4e8e")
	)
	(text "gate driver"
		(at 33.02 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "26175ffd-73fc-4e9f-933b-d23e772559b2")
	)
	(text "output bridge"
		(at 193.04 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "18fe7a91-2826-43f8-bd32-f32bd95e2205")
	)
	(text "filter, Zobel and a 4 ohm load"
		(at 317.5 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ca2c97aa-debb-4fae-b080-9d437b643ae3")
	)
	(text "U1 is the board's buffer U1C, U2 its inverter U1D, U3 the integrator U1B and U4 the oscillator's U2; U7/U8 are the PWM comparators U3/U4 and U20..U23 the four used sections of U5. One symbol per section, because a SPICE model has no units."
		(at 12.7 304.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2614eb07-c1a6-405e-9ef0-0bbcb4567ab4")
	)
	(text "R2/R3 are the level pot at 80 % of rotation. The 6 V virtual ground is an ideal source here: the real one is R1/R2/C1 and takes 2.5 s to settle, which is bench A's business, not a run that has to resolve a 250 kHz carrier."
		(at 12.7 312.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea73b434-d1e6-4d41-a4fd-8f91b00a4bcf")
	)
	(text "C3, the input DC block, is left out for the same reason -- with uic it would spend 15 ms charging. The source already sits at the virtual ground."
		(at 12.7 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a368af3-1264-45ab-9d91-390d91afb4ac")
	)
	(text "This is the sheet that answers the design question. At 1.77 Vrms in it should make about 12 W across 4 ohm -- and AUDIO_P should reach exactly 4.0 V at the bottom of its swing, which is the TL074's input common-mode floor. Full output and the input stage's limit arrive together; there is no headroom in hand."
		(at 12.7 330.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9d936b60-95df-44a7-90d1-f968031ed9a2")
	)
	(text "Measure over one audio cycle, past the bootstrap fill: RMS user0 FROM=400u TO=1400u gives 7.2 V, which is 13 W across 4 ohm, and MIN V(/AUDIO_P) FROM=400u TO=1400u gives 4.00 V. user0 is the differential output -- KiCad binds every user-defined signal to userN, and the measurement panel wants that name rather than the expression."
		(at 12.7 340.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "79f527d6-c030-408b-ab27-d8601ecdf380")
	)
	(text ".tran 20n 1.4m uic"
		(at 12.7 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "428a3823-4719-4e9a-a33f-c4fe5b1480c7")
	)
	(text "<-  back to the board schematic   classd.kicad_sch"
		(at 12.7 360.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		
			(href "file:../classd.kicad_sch")
		)
		(uuid "f0690a04-6809-43b7-9998-6797ba825649")
	)
